            "review_title": "Review at Phở Gà Số 7",
            "review_text": "Andrea L\n1 contribution\n0\nDelicious\nJun 2025 • Couples\nI had a great experience at this pho spot! The broth was flavorful and comforting, with just the right balance of spices. The noodles were soft but not mushy, and the meat was super tender. Everything tasted really fresh, and the portions were generous. The service was friendly and fast too. If you’re craving a warm bowl of pho, this place definitely hits the spot!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 19, 2025",
