            "review_text": "Gia Linh N\n3 contributions\n0\nI can eat the pho here every single day for all 3 meals\nJun 2025 • Family\nPhở Gà Số 7 serves a soul-warming bowl of chicken phở that feels like a quiet morning hug.\nThe broth is rich yet clear, full of depth and love. Each bite—chicken, noodles, herbs—is pure harmony. I love this place with my entire soul and I will come back here every time I come to Vietnam. I will be craving this so much when I return to the states.\nThis spot is simple, local, and unforgettable. No fluff—just phở that tastes like the heart of Vietnam.\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2025",
